From 2b141ed2c1b2ce8a4453e589ac5d04a4bbfacf0e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craterbrain <58347640+Craterbrain@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:31:29 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 20/75] PlaitOS: Section 2 fixes from review

- Advanced restart: the main-user check used getCallingUserId(), which in
  SystemUI is always the system user; ask UserTracker for the current user
- Power menu Users entry: count only switchable human users, so a work
  profile alone doesn't add it
- Navigation bar actions: kill app, last app and split screen do nothing
  while the lock screen is up (they would act on the app behind it)
- Notification kill button: hidden while the lock screen is up instead of
  shown and ignored; drop stray blank lines in the power menu imports

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WNZzm3ssZ7eH5QDg4P9AiP
---
 .../systemui/globalactions/GlobalActionsDialogLite.java  | 9 +++++----
 .../notification/row/NotificationConversationInfo.java   | 2 +-
 .../statusbar/notification/row/NotificationInfo.java     | 2 +-
 .../com/android/server/policy/PhoneWindowManager.java    | 6 ++++++
 4 files changed, 13 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/globalactions/GlobalActionsDialogLite.java b/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/globalactions/GlobalActionsDialogLite.java
